  "prefLabel": "He-E 720.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 720.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to describe:\n\n(a) The process for obtaining a confirmation of whether or not there is a match from the bureau of adult and aging services (BAAS) state registry;\n\n(b) The confidentiality and expungement of information contained on the BAAS state registry; and\n\n(c) For an employer of a program which is licensed, certified, or funded by the department to provide services to individuals, the process and criteria for granting a waiver to employ a person whose name has been confirmed as a match on the BAAS state registry.\n\nSource. #10191, eff 9-27-12; ss by #13602, eff 3-28-23, EXPIRES: 3-28-33",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-e700.html"
